      "headings": [
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "class": "heading-style-h2",
          "text": "Five steps to a clear plan"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h5",
          "text": "Discovery call"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h5",
          "text": "Financial review"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h5",
          "text": "Plan and proposal"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h5",
          "text": "Account setup"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h5",
          "text": "Ongoing reviews"
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Most clients go from first call to a fully working plan in four to six weeks.",
        "Your goals, timeline, income and how comfortable you are with risk.",
        "Accounts, pensions, debts and investments mapped in one place.",
        "A written plan with portfolio, savings and protection, and every fee shown.",
        "Accounts opened, transfers arranged and portfolios funded.",
        "Quarterly reports, rebalancing and a full review with your advisor."
      ],
