    {
      "tag": "section",
      "class": "section-why",
      "headings": [
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "class": "heading-style-h2",
          "text": "Why clients trust us with the long-term plan"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Independent recommendations"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h4",
          "text": "One advisor, start to finish"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Fees agreed in writing"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Plans in plain language"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Stress-tested first"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "class": "heading-style-h4",
          "text": "Reviewed as life changes"
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "We are not tied to any fund house, so every product in your plan is chosen on merit.",
        "The person who writes your plan is the person who reviews it with you each year.",
        "Planning and management fees are fixed in your proposal and never change without notice.",
        "Your plan is a short document you can read in one sitting, not a hundred pages of jargon.",
        "We model market falls, job changes and early retirement so the plan holds up in tough years.",
        "A new child, a sale or a move abroad triggers a review straight away, not at year end."
      ],
